section.para:
Usage is rather simple (this will stream the log to a file, named log.txt, and the stdout stream of the process: struct aiLogStream c;
c = aiGetPredefinedLogStream(aiDefaultLogStream_FILE,"log.txt");
aiAttachLogStream(&c);
c = aiGetPredefinedLogStream(aiDefaultLogStream_STDOUT,NULL);
aiAttachLogStream(&c);
